From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: frog-toolchain <frog-toolchain@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] uclibc-ng: add 1.0.59 to the version list

Add uClibc-ng 1.0.59 as a released version. bootstrap scans
packages/uClibc-ng/<version>/version.desc to generate both the
kconfig version list and maintainer/package-versions, so a released
1.0.59 makes crosstool-ng fetch the release tarball and apply the
per-version patches from the standard packages/uclibc-ng/1.0.59
local patch directory (DEVEL sources bypass that directory).
The SF2000 Linux build needs 1.0.59 for the static-PIE no-MMU
configuration (MAP_UNINITIALIZED / getconf / NOMMU-static-PIE fixes).
---
--- a/packages/uClibc-ng/1.0.59/chksum
+++ b/packages/uClibc-ng/1.0.59/chksum
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+md5 uClibc-ng-1.0.59.tar.xz 351795a782f4f322b60b65a3cefd687d
+sha1 uClibc-ng-1.0.59.tar.xz 445a9ebebb231b1a8d90ad1b9256883330983420
+sha256 uClibc-ng-1.0.59.tar.xz 86c6f15971bfb14156850f2e36906dac5a69df7b3e688216d1aea09d2db54174
+sha512 uClibc-ng-1.0.59.tar.xz 4876873920cced5f5521325502e258b0d2438bb7d5f2c4aca39962bbcd6bef730c5ddcd39c38e1d117598cabddeda02708f928874d0a92ac206e6bd8cb3f0173
--- a/packages/uClibc-ng/1.0.59/version.desc
+++ b/packages/uClibc-ng/1.0.59/version.desc
